<p>Consume a soul whole to rebuild your body, healing you for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">301, 398, 473, 537, 594</acronym> and generating <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">118, 155, 185, 209, 231</acronym> mana.</p><p>If used below 1 life the surge increases your spellpower by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15, 26, 35, 43, 50</acronym> for 10 turns.</p><p>The heal and mana increases with your Spellpower.</p>